    <briefdescription>
<para>Represents dry mass in the ecosystem simulation. </para>
    </briefdescription>
    <detaileddescription>
<para>Encapsulates a <ref refid="class_precise_double" kindref="compound">PreciseDouble</ref> value for dry mass, provides arithmetic operations, comparisons, and conversion from <ref refid="class_wet_mass" kindref="compound">WetMass</ref> or <ref refid="class_length" kindref="compound">Length</ref> using species-specific coefficients. </para>
    </detaileddescription>
